{"title":"Terracotta","slug":"Terracotta","pageid":3020,"revid":17223,"timestamp":"2025-02-15T02:51:27Z","lastEditor":"CattepyieZ","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater Island"},{"label":"Stone","value":"~$12.08/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"~$11.97/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"~$15.98/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.60.0"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"ore","text":"Ore"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\nTerracotta is one of the many rock nodes that are found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>.  These nodes are found in a cave located towards the left of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Illumine_Designs/\">Illumine Designs</a>, or under the bridges in the Oke Desert. \n\n<h2 id=\"ore\">Ore</h2>\n<p>The chart below displays all possible ore that spawns within this node.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BetterNewInkStone\">BetterNewInkStone</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Inkstone/\">Inkstone</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pyrite\">Pyrite</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pyrite\">Pyrite</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pyrite/\">Pyrite</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lithium\">Lithium</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lithium\">Lithium</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lithium/\">Lithium</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gold/\">Gold</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rose gold\">Rose gold</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rose gold\">Rose gold</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rose_Gold/\">Rose Gold</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Palladiumraw\">Palladiumraw</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Palladium/\">Palladium</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Uraniumraw\">Uraniumraw</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Uraniumraw\">Uraniumraw</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolve